window.MC_CONTENT_EXTRA.push({"a":"volibear","b":"masteryi","win":["Volibear","Volibear","Volibear","Skill","Skill","Master Yi","Master Yi"],"spikes":[{"when":"Lvl 1-3","text":"Q stun into Frenzied Maul healing beats his itemless kit, and Meditate is a channel your stun ends - run him down and make his farm cost health."},{"when":"Lvl 6","text":"Stormbringer's leap, bonus health and tower-disable let you force all-ins before his spike, but Highlander makes him immune to slows - your stun still lands, so open with it."},{"when":"1st item","text":"His Wuju true damage now shreds through your healing - the free-trade era is over, so fight only with full W marks and E shield."},{"when":"Late","text":"Two-plus items his true-damage melt and resets out-scale you; become the frontline stun-bot for your carries instead of his duel partner."}],"wants":{"you":["Early Q stun trades before his items","A tower dive window with Stormbringer's disable","Fights ended before his true damage stacks"],"foe":["Safe scaling to his first item","Meditate baiting out your burst rotation","Late-game resets through your whole team"]},"early":"The first three levels are yours. Master Yi's Alpha Strike (20s) makes him untargetable while it hits, but it's his only engage. Thundering Smash stuns him, and Meditate (10s) is a channel your stun cancels. Frenzied Maul's second bite heals more than his autos deal. At levels 4-5 it's even, as Wuju Style (14s) adds true damage to his autos and Double Strike hits twice. At 6 it stays even: Highlander (85s) makes him immune to slows, so Stormbringer's slow does nothing, but your stun still lands.","mid":"Levels 4-5 even out as you both scale without a clean kill threat, and 6 stays balanced: Stormbringer's bonus health and tower-disable let you force dives before his spike matures, but Highlander makes him immune to slows, so Sky Splitter only shields you - the stun has to open.","late":"From his first item on, E Wuju Style true damage cuts straight through your healing loop, and at two-plus items his shred and Highlander resets out-scale your entire kit in a duel - stop fighting him alone, peel with your stun, and let your health bar buy time for your carries to melt him.","whys":["Q Thundering Smash's stun and Maul healing out-trade him from level 1.","At 2 your empowered autos and sustain still beat his Meditate.","Level 3 your run-down and healing keep him off the wave before items.","Levels 4-5 are even - Alpha Strike goes untargetable through your bite.","At 6 Stormbringer's bonus health forces all-ins before his spike, but Highlander (85s) ignores your slows.","His first item and Wuju true damage shred you through your healing.","Two-plus items give him true-damage melt and resets that out-scale you."]});
